{"3386930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tools of the trade", "steam_appid": 3386930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a cozy medieval kingdom as a wandering craftsman, taking on jobs for townsfolk and learning how to make what they need through experimentation. Gather materials, discover recipes, and complete handcrafted quest chains as you work your way from newly promoted journeyman to true master of the craft.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover recipes through experimentation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-hand tactile crafting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel between towns on a branching caravan map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete multi-step jobs for townsfolk</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your recipe book as you work toward mastery</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-friendly and couch co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No high-stress timers</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Through Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every job comes with instructions. As you travel from town to town, you will be asked to create useful goods, repair structures, and help local communities. Figuring out how to craft what they need is part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a tactile two-hand system to pick up, carry, combine, and work with tools directly. Experiment with materials and crafting steps, uncover new recipes, and grow your recipe book over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/ccfad8c626e4b29bdc78542f5d6bde37.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/ccfad8c626e4b29bdc78542f5d6bde37.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/ccfad8c626e4b29bdc78542f5d6bde37.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traveling Jobs, Big and Small</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between towns and workshops in the world, taking on jobs that range from simple requests to larger community projects. While some ask for simple items, others require you to gather materials from different locations, prepare each part, and return with everything needed to complete the final job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each quest line is a chance to discover new recipes and move one step closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/26ff847521dd5737b494421272eeeb67.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/26ff847521dd5737b494421272eeeb67.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/26ff847521dd5737b494421272eeeb67.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo or Couch Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the adventure on your own or with up to 4 players in local couch co-op. Work side by side, split up simple tasks, or help each other complete larger jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full journey is playable solo from start to finish, while co-op offers a relaxed way to share the crafting experience with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/0c7212287c547a17c5367f95a822197c.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/0c7212287c547a17c5367f95a822197c.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/0c7212287c547a17c5367f95a822197c.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cozy World, No Timers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no high-stress timers pushing you through missions, giving you room to experiment, learn recipes, and enjoy the journey at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a playful medieval world, help its townsfolk through hands-on work, and steadily build your knowledge as you progress toward becoming a master craftsman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/d2bbeb4217a8cde9a15cbf6e9f7af36e.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/d2bbeb4217a8cde9a15cbf6e9f7af36e.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/d2bbeb4217a8cde9a15cbf6e9f7af36e.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a cozy medieval kingdom as a wandering craftsman, taking on jobs for townsfolk and learning how to make what they need through experimentation. Gather materials, discover recipes, and complete handcrafted quest chains as you work your way from newly promoted journeyman to true master of the craft.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover recipes through experimentation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-hand tactile crafting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel between towns on a branching caravan map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete multi-step jobs for townsfolk</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your recipe book as you work toward mastery</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-friendly and couch co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No high-stress timers</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Through Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every job comes with instructions. As you travel from town to town, you will be asked to create useful goods, repair structures, and help local communities. Figuring out how to craft what they need is part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a tactile two-hand system to pick up, carry, combine, and work with tools directly. Experiment with materials and crafting steps, uncover new recipes, and grow your recipe book over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/ccfad8c626e4b29bdc78542f5d6bde37.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/ccfad8c626e4b29bdc78542f5d6bde37.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/ccfad8c626e4b29bdc78542f5d6bde37.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traveling Jobs, Big and Small</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between towns and workshops in the world, taking on jobs that range from simple requests to larger community projects. While some ask for simple items, others require you to gather materials from different locations, prepare each part, and return with everything needed to complete the final job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each quest line is a chance to discover new recipes and move one step closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/26ff847521dd5737b494421272eeeb67.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/26ff847521dd5737b494421272eeeb67.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/26ff847521dd5737b494421272eeeb67.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo or Couch Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the adventure on your own or with up to 4 players in local couch co-op. Work side by side, split up simple tasks, or help each other complete larger jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full journey is playable solo from start to finish, while co-op offers a relaxed way to share the crafting experience with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/0c7212287c547a17c5367f95a822197c.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/0c7212287c547a17c5367f95a822197c.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/0c7212287c547a17c5367f95a822197c.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cozy World, No Timers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no high-stress timers pushing you through missions, giving you room to experiment, learn recipes, and enjoy the journey at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a playful medieval world, help its townsfolk through hands-on work, and steadily build your knowledge as you progress toward becoming a master craftsman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/d2bbeb4217a8cde9a15cbf6e9f7af36e.poster.avif?t=1785065583\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/d2bbeb4217a8cde9a15cbf6e9f7af36e.webm?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/extras/d2bbeb4217a8cde9a15cbf6e9f7af36e.mp4?t=1785065583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Discover recipes through experimentation in a cozy medieval crafting adventure. Use a tactile two-hand system, travel between towns, help locals with hands-on jobs, and work your way toward mastery solo or in couch co-op.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, German, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/84d3a272144c40670e0fbc716e4c13c9cb06c85d/header.jpg?t=1785065583", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386930/166dff7f1410c98aa019d61fd36096c450fa775a/capsule_231x8